  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee or oil in a cazuela over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the ginger and garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the shrimp paste and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the char-grill-yang, cumin powder, coriander powder, turmeric, cayenne pepper, salt, and pepper. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the saeujeot and cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the coconut milk and lemon juice. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5-7 minutes, or until the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."
